{"overview":"وایکینگ‌ها ماجراجویی‌های راگنار لاثبروک، بزرگترین قهرمان عصر خود را روایت ‌می‌کند. سریال حماسه‌های دارودسته‌ برادرن راگنار و خوانواده‌اش را روایت می‌کند، و اینکه او تبدیل به پادشاه قبایل وایکینگ می‌شود. همچنین به عنوان یک جنگجوی بی‌باک، راگنار مظهر سنت‌های اسکاندیناوی و ازخودگذشتگی به خدایان است.افسانه‌ها اینگونه سخن می‌گویند که او از نوادگان مستقیم اودین، خدای جنگ و جنگجویان است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The adventures of Ragnar Lothbrok, the greatest hero of his age. The series tells the sagas of Ragnar's band of Viking brothers and his family, as he rises to become King of the Viking tribes. As well as being a fearless warrior, Ragnar embodies the Norse traditions of devotion to the gods. Legend has it that he was a direct descendant of Odin, the god of war and warriors.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":31,"y":2013,"poster":"/woP1jNltcWMLqK6pcFqPJq6pyJ6.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":9,"y":2013,"poster":"/uYaskJzmBhBdvkitDTjlH6gj9Pt.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2014,"poster":"/g2Pgu5Dae9P99yJs0xZQtEagA76.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2015,"poster":"/jICv5UxLDvUqCp1D2jAb0PSJWAw.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":20,"y":2016,"poster":"/vDomkDsMrMFkTMIdzl6auzEDms7.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":20,"y":2017,"poster":"/iOVC9GVEEVTGN3eYcDVkmDkOa11.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":20,"y":2019,"poster":"/3VsziFTocbNyGQjM2QNLJF41ccX.jpg"}],"episodes":89,"crew":["Michael Hirst"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["CA","IE"],"cast":[{"name":"Alex Høgh Andersen","role":"Ivar Lothbrok / Ivar the Boneless","photo":"/kDO1gFqMnsV5gCQsMgEL9BZongX.jpg"},{"name":"Jordan Patrick Smith","role":"Ubbe Lothbrok","photo":"/v9hY8mCo7Dk5AptzZbLE2F8Tzhu.jpg"},{"name":"Marco Ilsø","role":"Hvitserk Lothbrok","photo":"/xfcrAKFHq81VVO9axg1zP8JrYCN.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Franzén","role":"King Harald Finehair","photo":"/zJ8JV2TefLQIT5DzMinl5eoK5YH.jpg"},{"name":"Georgia Hirst","role":"Torvi","photo":"/7xHIjmpI4jW